      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seaford%2C_Victoria"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A 1985 Monash University report highlighted Seaford Swamp as a remnant of Carrum Swamp, recommending lagoons and tree plantations.",
